              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwerinde, mutanga kuhurira Ogwo orikugamba. Ahakuba abaayangire kworobera owaabahaniire omu nsi, ku baraabe batarakizire, itwe turyakira tuta ku turyanga kworobera Ogwo otuhana naayema omu iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
